---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Start a Conversation | Free 20-Min Google Meet | Pikes Peak Web Designs"
description: "A 20-minute call on Google Meet. No pressure, no deposit. Tell us about your business and what you'd like your site to do."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Start a Conversation</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="section-label">Let's talk</span>
    <h1>Tell us about <em>your business.</em></h1>
    <p>A 20-minute call on Google Meet. Nothing to pay, nothing to sign. Call, text, email, or send the form; whichever is easiest for you.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="section-label">Reach out any way</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="max-width:22ch">Four easy ways to get in touch.</h2>
        <p>We respond within one business day. usually much sooner. Email, phone, and text are all monitored during business hours.</p>

        <ul class="contact-info-list">
          <li class="contact-info-item">
            <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Call or text</h4>
              <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
              <p style="font-size:0.85rem">Mon&ndash;Fri, 8am&ndash;6pm MT</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="contact-info-item">
            <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22 6 12 13 2 6"/></svg></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Email</h4>
              <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
              <p style="font-size:0.85rem">Reply within one business day</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="contact-info-item">
            <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="m6 12 4 2 4-2"/></svg></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Calls on Google Meet</h4>
              <p>Video or audio, whichever you prefer. No app to install.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="contact-info-item">
            <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Based in</h4>
              <p>{{ site.address.city }}, {{ site.address.state }} &middot; serving the U.S. &amp; Canada</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;padding:1.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius)">
          <h4 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1rem">What happens next</h4>
          <ol style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.85rem">
            <li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0.85rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6">
              <span style="width:28px;height:28px;background:var(--navy-900);color:var(--gold-400);border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem">1</span>
              <span>We read your message and reply within one business day.</span>
            </li>
            <li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0.85rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6">
              <span style="width:28px;height:28px;background:var(--navy-900);color:var(--gold-400);border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem">2</span>
              <span>We schedule a 20-minute discovery call on Google Meet.</span>
            </li>
            <li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0.85rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6">
              <span style="width:28px;height:28px;background:var(--navy-900);color:var(--gold-400);border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem">3</span>
              <span>If we're the right fit, you sign a simple agreement and we start building.</span>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-form-card">
        <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:0.35rem">Send us a message</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Fill out the form and we'll be in touch within one business day.</p>

        <form id="contactForm" data-web3forms data-redirect="/thank-you/" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="form">
          <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="YOUR_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY">
          <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New contact, Pikes Peak Web Designs">
          <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Pikes Peak Web Designs">
          <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="firstName">First name <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="firstName" name="firstName" placeholder="Jane" required autocomplete="given-name">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="lastName">Last name <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="lastName" name="lastName" placeholder="Smith" required autocomplete="family-name">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="businessName">Business name <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="businessName" name="businessName" placeholder="Smith's Roofing Co." required autocomplete="organization">
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="jane@yourbusiness.com" required autocomplete="email">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="(555) 123-4567" autocomplete="tel">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="currentSite">Do you currently have a website?</label>
            <select id="currentSite" name="currentSite">
              <option value="">Choose one…</option>
              <option value="none">No; I need one built from scratch</option>
              <option value="wordpress">Yes; it's on WordPress</option>
              <option value="builder">Yes; Wix, Squarespace, or similar</option>
              <option value="custom">Yes; it's a custom site</option>
              <option value="other">Yes (something else)</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Tell us about your business <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="What does your business do? What would you like your new site to do for you? Any specific concerns or goals?" required></textarea>
          </div>

          <div id="form-error" role="alert" class="form-error">
            Something went wrong. Please try again or email us directly at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.
          </div>

          <button type="submit" id="contactSubmit" class="btn btn-primary btn-full btn-lg">Send message</button>
          <p class="form-hint" style="text-align:center;margin-top:0.75rem">We respect your privacy. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="inline-link">privacy policy</a>.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sunshine-stats" style="margin:0">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-num">$0</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Required to start today</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-num">2&ndash;3 wk</div>
        <div class="stat-label">From discovery call to launch</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-num">$175</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Flat monthly rate (everything included)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
